gold_answer:
You cannot control what to load and what do not without ` Select ` , full
entity is loaded by default. But you can configure your entity using [ Table
splitting ](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/ef/core/modeling/table-
splitting#table-splitting)

With ` Select ` it is easy and preferrable, but I recommend to use special DTO
classses for that:



    var invoices = await _payoutDbContext.Invoices
        .Select(x => new InvoiceDto
        {
            Id = x.Id
            // ... other properties

            InvoiceFiles = x.InvoiceFiles.Select(f => new InvoiceFileDto
            {
                Id = f.Id,
                FileName = f.FileName
            }).ToList()
        })
        .AsSplitQuery()
        .ToListAsync();

